    <label class="cinder-slider">A → B <output data-cinder-mix-value></output><input aria-label="风格混合" type="range" min="0" max="1" step=".01" data-cinder-mix></label>
    <p class="cinder-note">混合会重设笔触、光色和配色；之后可逐项微调。</p>
  </details>
